abstract: Data, analysis software, fixed configurations, saved predictions and attributions, preprocessing
  controls, figures and verification evidence accompanying a study of steel UTS generalization and the
  diagnostic value of attribution spread. The analysis data contain 1,360 records, 562 supplied grade
  identifiers, 17 families and 683 derived split units. The software license is MIT; data and research-output
  licensing are documented separately in LICENSING.md.
